mapping "b122.1" source="b122" target="SNOMED_CT:363910003" relationship=related_to {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source b122 SNOMED CT 363910003 (Global psychosocial functions) = ICF b122: the mental functions
        that develop over time as the integration of all mental functions, oriented to self and others,
